{
    "name": "戶外活動",
    "data": {
        "phase1": [
            {
                "text": "今天是星期六。主角正在和哥哥聊天，<br>討論明天的行程。來看看他們要去哪裡玩吧！"
            },
            {
                "text": "Temu, rex ṟumuw ka cuxan, maha su inu’?",
                "textCh": "Temu，明天是星期天，你打算去哪裡？",
                "sound": "text/sound/65646/918293",
                "image": "boy-1.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "cuxan maha min umaxiy ci seng ki’ syaw na gong laha ci Yabi’, maha su aw?",
                "textCh": "我明天要和Yabi’去溪邊烤肉，你呢？",
                "sound": "text/sound/65646/918294",
                "image": "boy-2.png",
                "background": "1-2.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "yona ramas salagan pungan, angat cu magaluw musa aw?",
                "textCh": "聽起來很好玩！我也可以一起去嗎？",
                "sound": "text/sound/65646/918295",
                "image": "boy-1.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "kaṟali’ ka yaya’ hang!",
                "textCh": "你先問媽媽！",
                "sound": "text/sound/65646/918296",
                "image": "boy-2.png",
                "background": "1-2.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "yaya’, anak cu magaluw ci asuran malikur musa syaw na gong aw?",
                "textCh": "媽媽，我可以跟哥哥一起去溪邊嗎？",
                "sound": "text/sound/65646/918297",
                "image": "boy-1.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "ho! anak su musa ga taxi’ tikiy nak",
                "textCh": "可以，但你們要小心喔！",
                "sound": "text/sound/65646/918298",
                "image": "mom.png",
                "background": "1-3.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "ho! baun min, patabale min makakatox.",
                "textCh": "沒問題，我們一定會的！",
                "sound": "text/sound/65646/918299",
                "image": "boy-1.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            }
        ],
